  "decision_summary": "High: the stavudine-like thymine dideoxynucleoside is supported by multiple transferable absolute-bioavailability measurements in closely related pyrimidine dideoxynucleosides (emtricitabine, lamivudine, zalcitabine), all well above 20%, and no transferable evidence supports F<20%; the physicochemical prior is also favorable."
}

